Core Styling: styles.css

Includes fluid typography, accessible contrast, light and dark themes using modern CSS custom properties, grid layouts, responsive tables, and zero external framework bloat.

CSS
:root {
  --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;

  --bg-primary: #f8fafc;
  --bg-surface: #ffffff;
  --bg-subtle: #f1f5f9;
  --border-color: #e2e8f0;
  --text-main: #0f172a;
  --text-muted: #475569;
  --primary: #0284c7;
  --primary-hover: #0369a1;
  --accent-green: #059669;
  --accent-amber: #d97706;
  --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  --radius: 8px;
}

[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg-primary: #0b1120;
  --bg-surface: #1e293b;
  --bg-subtle: #334155;
  --border-color: #334155;
  --text-main: #f8fafc;
  --text-muted: #94a3b8;
  --primary: #38bdf8;
  --primary-hover: #7dd3fc;
  --accent-green: #34d399;
  --accent-amber: #fbbf24;
  --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
}

*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  background-color: var(--bg-primary);
  color: var(--text-main);
  line-height: 1.6;
  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
}

.container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 1.5rem;
}

/* Header & Navigation */
header.site-header {
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

.nav-wrapper {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  height: 4.5rem;
}

.brand {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: var(--text-main);
  text-decoration: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}

.site-nav ul {
  display: flex;
  list-style: none;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  align-items: center;
}

.site-nav a {
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  transition: color 0.15s ease;
}

.site-nav a:hover, .site-nav a.active {
  color: var(--primary);
}

.theme-toggle {
  background: none;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  color: var(--text-main);
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* Typography & Layout */
main {
  padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 1.85rem;
  margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

h3 {
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

p {
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  color: var(--text-main);
}

.lead {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

/* Badges */
.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 9999px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.badge-solar { background-color: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
.badge-water { background-color: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; }
.badge-statute { background-color: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }

[data-theme="dark"] .badge-solar { background-color: #78350f; color: #fef3c7; }
[data-theme="dark"] .badge-water { background-color: #0c4a6e; color: #e0f2fe; }
[data-theme="dark"] .badge-statute { background-color: #14532d; color: #dcfce7; }

/* Cards & Grids */
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin: 2rem 0;
}

.card {
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.75rem;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

/* Tables */
.table-container {
  overflow-x: auto;
  margin: 2rem 0;
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}

table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}

th, td {
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

th {
  background-color: var(--bg-subtle);
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* Media Figures */
figure {
  margin: 2rem 0;
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  overflow: hidden;
}

figure img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  max-height: 450px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

figcaption {
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

/* Forms & Newsletter */
.newsletter-card {
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border: 2px solid var(--primary);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 2.5rem;
  margin: 3rem 0;
  text-align: center;
}

.newsletter-form {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
  flex-direction: column;
}

@media (min-width: 540px) {
  .newsletter-form {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}

.newsletter-form input[type="email"] {
  flex-grow: 1;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background-color: var(--bg-primary);
  color: var(--text-main);
  font-size: 1rem;
}

.btn-primary {
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  background-color: var(--primary);
  color: #ffffff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  background-color: var(--primary-hover);
}

.form-feedback {
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* Interactive Calculator */
.calc-wrapper {
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 2rem;
  margin: 2rem 0;
}

.slider-group {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.slider-group label {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

input[type="range"] {
  width: 100%;
}

.calc-results {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding-top: 1.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.stat-box {
  background-color: var(--bg-subtle);
  padding: 1rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  text-align: center;
}

.stat-box .number {
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  display: block;
}

/* Footer */
footer.site-footer {
  background-color: var(--bg-surface);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  padding: 3rem 0;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

Master Pillar Hub: index.html

The pillar page features the newsletter subscription box linked to /api/subscribe, client-side keyword search, dark-mode toggle, JSON-LD schemas, and deep contextual links.

HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Global Sustainable Data Center Benchmark | Closed-Loop & Renewable Infrastructure</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Technical, legal, and engineering directory analyzing zero-water closed-loop cooled and 100% renewable-powered data centers worldwide.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://sustainable-dc.pages.dev/">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "Global Sustainable Data Center Benchmark",
    "url": "https://sustainable-dc.pages.dev/",
    "potentialAction": {
      "@type": "SearchAction",
      "target": "https://sustainable-dc.pages.dev/?q={search_term_string}",
      "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
    }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container nav-wrapper">
      <a href="index.html" class="brand">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
        GreenCompute DB
      </a>
      <nav class="site-nav">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="facilities.html">Facilities</a></li>
          <li><a href="cooling-tech.html">Cooling Engineering</a></li>
          <li><a href="regulations.html">Regulations</a></li>
          <li><a href="baseload-nuclear.html">Clean Baseload</a></li>
          <li><a href="sources.html">Repository</a></li>
          <li><button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-btn" aria-label="Toggle Theme">Toggle Theme</button></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <span class="badge badge-water">Technical & Regulatory Benchmark</span>
      <h1>Decarbonized Compute & Closed-Loop Architecture</h1>
      <p class="lead">Tracking the global shift to zero-water direct-to-chip heat rejection, 100% renewable power purchase agreements, and mandatory statutory energy codes.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Instant Topic Search -->
    <div style="margin: 2rem 0;">
      <input type="search" id="quick-search" placeholder="Filter facilities, laws, cooling topologies..." style="width: 100%; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--bg-surface); color: var(--text-main);">
    </div>

    <div class="grid" id="searchable-cards">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge badge-water">Thermodynamics</span>
        <h3>Closed-Loop Direct-to-Chip</h3>
        <p>Traditional cooling towers evaporate 1.5 to 3.0 liters per kilowatt-hour. Closed-loop liquid cold plates paired with external dry coolers eliminate operational evaporation entirely.</p>
        <p><a href="cooling-tech.html" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Inspect Thermodynamic Architecture →</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge badge-statute">Statutory Directives</span>
        <h3>Mandatory International Standards</h3>
        <p>From Germany's EnEfG PUE caps and mandatory district waste heat recovery to Singapore's DC-CFA2 green energy mandates and Irish renewable additionality rules.</p>
        <p><a href="regulations.html" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Compare Global Statutory Frameworks →</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge badge-solar">Operational Campuses</span>
        <h3>Global Zero-Water & Renewable Sites</h3>
        <p>Analyzing operating facilities including the 100% solar Moro Hub in Dubai, Microsoft's closed-loop Arizona facilities, and Iceland's geothermal Verne Global campus.</p>
        <p><a href="facilities.html" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Browse Global Facility Database →</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge badge-solar">Baseload Integration</span>
        <h3>Behind-the-Meter Nuclear & SMRs</h3>
        <p>Examining multi-gigawatt transmission queues, the Crane Clean Energy Center restart, Google's Kairos SMR agreement, and the landmark FERC Docket ER24-2172 ruling.</p>
        <p><a href="baseload-nuclear.html" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Explore Clean Baseload Strategies →</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Image Figure with Source Attribution -->
    <figure>
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Data_center_cooling_tower.jpg/1280px-Data_center_cooling_tower.jpg" alt="Industrial evaporative cooling towers mounted on a data center in Mesa, Arizona" loading="lazy">
