A single self-contained builder script (build_zip.py).

Save this single file, run it once in your terminal or command prompt, and it will immediately generate greencompute-site.zip in your current directory with all 13 files, images, CSS, JavaScript, database schemas, and edge functions organized in their exact folder structure.

Step 1: Generate the ZIP File (One Single Step)

