    </section>

    <h2>Primary Government Statutes & Directives</h2>
    <ul>
      <li id="enefg-germany" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <strong>German Federal Energy Efficiency Act (EnEfG § 11)</strong><br>
        Statutory requirements for data center efficiency, PUE thresholds, and mandatory waste heat reuse.<br>
        <a href="https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/enefg/__11.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--primary);">gesetze-im-internet.de/enefg/__11.html ↗</a>
      </li>
      <li id="eu-eed" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <strong>European Union Recast Energy Efficiency Directive (Directive (EU) 2023/1791)</strong><br>
        Delegated regulation establishing the European database and energy ratings for facilities exceeding 500 kW.<br>
        <a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32023L1791" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--primary);">eur-lex.europa.eu — Directive (EU) 2023/1791 ↗</a>
      </li>
      <li id="cru-ireland" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
