Why Cloudflare Showed That Warning

Cloudflare Pages’ web dashboard drag-and-drop tool does not compile a /functions folder—it only parses /functions when using the terminal command-line tool (wrangler) or Git.

However, Cloudflare’s dashboard drag-and-drop fully supports a single _worker.js file at the root (Pages Advanced Mode).

By switching from /functions/api/subscribe.js to a root _worker.js, the warning disappears, and Cloudflare compiles the API endpoint and the static site together.

The Fixed Builder Script

Save this updated script as build_zip.py and run python build_zip.py (or python3 build_zip.py). It will immediately output a clean greencompute-site.zip tailored specifically for Cloudflare's drag-and-drop uploader.

Python
