      <h1>International Legal Frameworks and Statutory Mandates</h1>
      <p class="lead">Governments worldwide have enacted binding statutory requirements governing data center power usage, mandatory renewable procurement, and thermal waste heat reuse.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Jurisdiction / Law</th>
            <th scope="col">Scope / Threshold</th>
            <th scope="col">Mandatory Renewable Target</th>
