            <td>Transmission substations; watershed basins; municipal district heat networks.</td>
            <td>GIS transmission maps; River Basin Commission withdrawal permits; municipal plans.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row"><strong>Why</strong><br><small>Drivers</small></th>
            <td>Analyze commercial, economic, and policy imperatives.</td>
            <td>Fiber route proximity; 24/7 carbon-free energy goals; avoidance of retail network tariffs.</td>
            <td>Integrated Resource Plans (IRPs); Corporate ESG filings; Regional Reliability Assessments.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row"><strong>How</strong><br><small>Mechanisms</small></th>
            <td>Analyze contracting, grid ties, and environmental permits.</td>
            <td>Nuclear PPAs; Behind-the-Meter (BTM) ISAs; NPDES discharge permits; DOE Title XVII loans.</td>
            <td>FERC Interconnection Dockets; EPA NPDES permits; NEPA Environmental Impact Statements.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
